password-blacklist.txt is derived from SecLists (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018 Daniel Miessler):
https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists/blob/4c0fd59432ab8508edc23b3c880127edb12e34d5/Passwords/Common-Credentials/xato-net-10-million-passwords-1000000.txt
Kept: entries of 10+ characters (shorter ones already fail the realm's length(10) policy),
lower-cased (Keycloak compares case-insensitively), de-duplicated.
